      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of recurrent angina 3 years following sole therapy transmyocardial laser revascularization (TMR) is described. Repeat sole therapy TMR with the Holmium:YAG system was performed and resulted in complete and immediate angina relief. Repeat TMR should be considered in patients with angina recurrence who underwent primary TMR."},
